warning: $REPO/pkg/spec/agent/testdata/good/bom-crlf.yaml:1: best effort (host_sockets/root-tier): with no net: section the supervisor's relay and Landlock refuse outside sockets, as at tier landlock; root tiers also carry immutable Unix name checks, but those programs do not establish a peer inode for every alias, and a send the supervisor continues can re-read a changed destination: best effort at the root tiers for aliases and unsupported datagrams; the cell is recorded in run_start best_effort and never counted as enforced (ADR 0070) [unenforced]
  fix: add a net: section naming every endpoint the agent needs, whose unix: entries the root tiers admit in the kernel where their unix programs load, or pin tier: landlock, which makes no root-tier claim
